<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Workspace · JouleLab</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('nav') %>
  <section class="ws">
    <p class="eyebrow mono">WORKSPACE · CODE OPTIMISATION CHECK</p>
    <h1>Paste firmware.<br><em>Find the waste.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">A rule-based check for ESP32 Arduino sketches. It flags patterns that keep the CPU or radio awake and projects the runtime effect with the same model as the lab.</p>
    <div class="devbar" id="devbar">
      <p class="mono small devtitle">JOULELAB WORKSPACE · BUILD · FLASH · DEBUG</p>
      <div class="devrow">
        <label><span class="mono small">BOARD</span><select id="devboard"><option>Loading…</option></select></label>
        <label><span class="mono small">SERIAL PORT</span><select id="devport"><option value="">Loading…</option></select></label>
        <button class="chip2 devicon" id="devrefresh" title="Refresh serial ports">↻</button>
        <div class="devbtns">
          <button class="devbtn" id="verify" title="Compile (pio run)">✓ Verify</button>
          <button class="devbtn" id="upload" title="Compile and flash (pio run -t upload)">→ Upload</button>
          <button class="devbtn run" id="run" title="Build, flash, then open the terminal with the board's output">▶ Run</button>
          <button class="devbtn" id="debug" title="Start a GDB session (pio debug)">⏯ Debug</button>
          <button class="devbtn stop" id="stop" disabled title="Stop the running build, upload or debug session">■ Stop</button>
          <button class="chip2" id="monitor" title="Open the board's serial port through JouleLab's shared serial connection">Serial monitor</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="devinfo mono small"><span id="devinfo">Checking PlatformIO…</span>
        <span class="devlinks"><button class="linkbtn" id="openproj">Open board project in editor</button><button class="linkbtn" id="resetproj">Reset board project</button></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="wsbar">
      <button class="runbtn" id="analyze">Analyze <span>▶</span></button>
      <button class="chip2" id="ai">AI suggestions ✦</button>
      <button class="chip2" id="sample">Load sample</button>
      <button class="chip2" id="apply" disabled>Apply suggested fixes</button>
      <button class="chip2" id="undo" disabled>Undo</button>
      <button class="chip2" id="copy">Copy</button>
      <button class="chip2" id="download">Download .ino</button>
      <button class="chip2" id="clear">Clear</button>
    </div>
    <div class="wsbar tune mono">
      <label>Energy model <select id="board"><% boards.forEach(b => { %><option><%= b %></option><% }) %></select></label>
      <label>Cycle <input id="interval" type="number" min="2" max="60" value="10"> s</label>
      <label>Battery <input id="capacity" type="number" min="100" max="10000" step="100" value="2000"> mAh</label>
      <span id="status" class="small"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="wsgrid">
      <div class="ed"><div class="gut mono" id="gut">1</div><textarea id="code" class="mono" spellcheck="false" placeholder="// Paste your ESP32 sketch here, or press “Load sample”"></textarea></div>
      <div class="res">
        <div class="score"><b id="score">–</b><div><p class="mono small">OPTIMISATION SCORE</p><p id="verdict">Run an analysis to see results.</p></div></div>
        <div class="rt"><div><p class="mono small">RUNTIME NOW</p><b id="dnow">–</b></div><div><p class="mono small">IF ALL FIXED</p><b id="dafter">–</b></div></div>
        <div id="finds"></div>
        <div id="ai-out"></div>
        <p class="mono small foot2">Static pattern check, not a profiler. Review every fix, then measure on hardware.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="console" id="console">
      <div class="ctabs">
        <button class="on" data-con="out">Output</button>
        <button data-con="mon">Serial monitor</button>
        <button data-con="log" title="A second board's text output (e.g. ESP32 logs) while the NUCLEO measures">Log port</button>
        <span class="mono small" id="jobstate"></span>
        <button class="chip2" id="conclear">Clear</button>
      </div>
      <pre class="con mono" id="con-out">Compiler output will appear here.</pre>
      <pre class="con mono" id="con-mon" hidden>Serial monitor will display real board output.</pre>
      <div class="logbar mono" id="logbar" hidden>
        <span>LOG PORT</span><select id="logportsel"></select>
        <select id="logbaud"><option>115200</option><option>9600</option><option>57600</option><option>230400</option><option>460800</option><option>921600</option></select>
        <button class="chip2" id="logconnect" type="button">Open log port</button><span id="logstate"></span>
      </div>
      <pre class="con mono" id="con-log" hidden>A second board's text (e.g. ESP32 Serial.println) appears here, while the main connection keeps measuring.</pre>
      <form class="gdb mono" id="termform" hidden>
        <span>&gt;</span><input id="termcmd" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Type to the board (sent through the serial port)">
        <select id="termeol" title="Line ending"><option value="\n">LF</option><option value="\r\n">CR+LF</option><option value="\r">CR</option><option value="">none</option></select>
        <button class="chip2" type="submit">Send</button>
      </form>
      <form class="gdb mono" id="gdbform" hidden>
        <span>(gdb)</span><input id="gdbcmd" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="continue · next · step · bt · info locals">
        <button class="chip2" type="submit">Send</button>
        <span class="gdbquick"><button type="button" class="chip2" data-gdb="continue">continue</button><button type="button" class="chip2" data-gdb="next">next</button><button type="button" class="chip2" data-gdb="step">step</button><button type="button" class="chip2" data-gdb="bt">bt</button><button type="button" class="chip2" data-gdb="info registers">registers</button></span>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script src="/js/fx.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/workspace.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
